<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Insta Fake Clone Detector - BlackCatHacks</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<style>
body{background:#000;color:#0f0;font-family:Arial;padding:20px;text-align:center}
.box{background:#111;border:1px solid #0f0;padding:20px;border-radius:15px;max-width:500px;margin:auto}
input{width:90%;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:none;margin:10px 0}
button{background:#0f0;color:#000;padding:12px 20px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;margin:5px}
a{color:#0f0;display:block;margin:8px 0;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #0f0;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h2>🔍 Insta Fake Clone Detector</h2>
<p>Check if someone is using your name to create a fake ID</p>

<div class="box">
<input id="user" placeholder="Enter your Instagram Username (without @)">
<button onclick="check()">Check Now</button>
<div id="result" style="margin-top:20px;text-align:left"></div>
</div>

<script>
function check(){
let u=document.getElementById('user').value.trim();
if(!u){alert('Please enter username!');return}
let r=document.getElementById('result');
r.innerHTML = `
<h3>Result for: ${u}</h3>
<p>Click on the links below to check:</p>
<a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=site:instagram.com+${u}" target="_blank">1. Search ${u} on Google</a>
<a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=${u}+instagram+fake+account" target="_blank">2. Check fake account reports</a>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/${u}_" target="_blank">3. Check: ${u}_ (underscore clone)</a>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/${u}.official" target="_blank">4. Check: ${u}.official</a>
<a href="https://images.google.com/" target="_blank">5. Check your DP on Google Reverse Image Search</a>
<p style="color:yellow">Tip: If you find a fake account, report it on Instagram > Report > Pretending to be someone.</p>
`;
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
